# Pinned SHA-256 digests for the `rustup-init` bootstrap binary (Issue #1911).
#
# Consumed by scripts/install-rustup.sh, which downloads the binary for the
# detected host target from
#   https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/archive/<version>/<target>/rustup-init
# and refuses to execute it unless the bytes match the digest recorded here.
#
# Provenance: each digest is the contents of the `.sha256` file published by
# the Rust project alongside the artefact, i.e.
#   https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/archive/1.29.0/<target>/rustup-init.sha256
# Verified against the downloaded artefact on 2026-08-03.
#
# To bump: change RUSTUP_VERSION in scripts/install-rustup.sh, then replace
# every digest below with the corresponding published `.sha256` value for the
# new version. Both files must move together.
#
# Format: <sha256>  <target-triple>   (comments and blank lines are ignored)

4acc9acc76d5079515b46346a485974457b5a79893cfb01112423c89aeb5aa10  x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
9732d6c5e2a098d3521fca8145d826ae0aaa067ef2385ead08e6feac88fa5792  aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu
9cd3fda5fd293890e36ab271af6a786ee22084b5f6c2b83fd8323cec6f0992c1  x86_64-unknown-linux-musl
88761caacddb92cd79b0b1f939f3990ba1997d701a38b3e8dd6746a562f2a759  aarch64-unknown-linux-musl
33cf85df9142bc6d29cbc62fa5ca1d4c29622cddb55213a4c1a43c457fb9b2d7  x86_64-apple-darwin
aeb4105778ca1bd3c6b0e75768f581c656633cd51368fa61289b6a71696ac7e1  aarch64-apple-darwin
